Also need to allocate vehicle units to them (vehicle_allocated). We have three vehicle units: alpha, beta, gamma. We'll need to allocate maybe one each.

We also need to attach task profile to them (candidate_task_profile_linked). We have route_task_profile_alpha.

Thus for each of origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha we need to:

- create_candidate
- allocate_vehicle_unit (pick a vehicle)
