Action assemble_transport_leg parameters: origin_availability, destination_availability, origin_node, destination_node, transport_leg.

Precondition includes origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available.

