Thus we need to prepare origin and destination (create, allocate vehicle, attach task profile, confirm prepared, activate node, assign operator, lock) before we can lock them. Actually lock requires candidate_prepared and candidate_operator_linked and origin_node_ready. So we need to activate node before lock.

